From 0b03dedf2c721934fdd79e9cb6d49a2e7b59c045 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: swissMack <tmackmood@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 12:33:21 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Add "webui start": restart straight into the Web CLI

Boards without a screen pick WiFi Connect with a button press in the
first 3 seconds after reset. "webui start" (in Wi-Fi mode) saves a
one-shot NVS flag and restarts; the next boot reads and clears it and
goes straight to WiFi Connect. A later reset is back to the usual
selection, so the board cannot get stuck in Web CLI mode. Needs saved
credentials; if WiFi Connect fails, the existing fallback to USB serial
applies.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
